cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ClusterAlgebras.jl: exact computation with cluster algebras in Julia"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for computing with cluster algebras: quivers and seed mutation over
  fraction fields, principal and geometric coefficients (c-vectors, g-vectors,
  F-polynomials), root systems and finite-type classification, mutation classes and
  exchange graphs, maximal green sequences and Donaldson-Thomas transformations, Y-systems
  and periodicity, friezes, folding, and the cluster structures on Grassmannians.
type: software
authors:
